 using [libjpeg-turbo](https://libjpeg-turbo.org/) instead. In my testing it runs in 85% of the time of libjpeg, with further improvement possible if we enable SIMD.\r\n\r\n- Fixes #45523\r\n- Fixes #75349\r\n- Fixes #91600\r\n- Fixes #92017\r\n- Fixes #103951\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n- [x] implement compression and saving\r\n- [x] more error checking\r\n- [x] test on linux\r\n- [x] test on android\r\n- [x] test on windows\r\n- [x] tested on Mac / iOS via unit tests in build (don't have a mac)\r\n- [x] license and copyright information\r\n- [x] remove manually created jconfig.h, jversion.h, and jconfigint.h, move to patches\r\n- [x] pair down added third-party files to the essentials\r\n- [x] have thorvg use this library instead of jpeg-compressor\r\n- [x] test basis_universal in editor after removing jpeg-compressor\r\n- [x] replace jpg module with this one and keep the jpg module name\r\n- [x] remove bmp file support (or use it instead of the bmp module)\r\n- [x] remove ppm file support\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471795,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE3OTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:thirdparty","name":"topic:thirdparty","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"